cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ASGO, please cite it as below."
title: "AI Security Governance Ontology (ASGO)"
abstract: >-
  A modular OWL/RDF ontology linking AI systems, AI security threats, controls
  and governance requirements from the EU AI Act (as amended by the Digital
  Omnibus), NIST AI RMF, NIST CSF 2.0, the OECD AI Principles, the OWASP Top 10
  for LLM and Agentic Applications and MITRE ATLAS, with expert-reviewed
  framework mappings and practitioner cases.
